      "poi_id": "p11",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Chợ Hàn is the city's beating market heart by the river: dried squid, silk, and a snack at every turn. Get lost between the stalls and let your nose lead."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p26",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Cộng Cà Phê is a little green time capsule with strong coffee and a view over the street. Perfect for a slow farewell sip."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p15",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "The Sun Wheel turns slowly over the river as the sky softens. Up top, the whole city spreads out like a farewell postcard."
    }
  ]
}
```

```json
{
  "stops": [
    {
      "poi_id": "p21",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Mì Quảng (turmeric noodles with pork, shrimp and a sesame cracker) here is the real first bite of the city. Slurp loud, it's a compliment."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p27",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Egg coffee with a view of the river as the sky turns gold. Sweet, creamy, and very hard to share."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p4",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "The dragon breathes fire and water when the city lights come on. Stand back unless you want a free shower."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p28",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Night market energy with grilled skewers and cold beer. Follow the smoke and the crowd."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p16",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Cocktails high above the river with the whole city sparkling below. One drink, then we call it a night."
    }
  ]
}
```

