      "note": "Up the mountain we go — clouds, cable cars, and a whole theme park in the trees. Give it the full half-day, no rushing."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p17",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Giant stone hands holding a golden ribbon of a bridge. Walk it slow, the view does the talking."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p18",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "A quiet pagoda tucked into the hillside. Good place to catch your breath and let the incense settle the day."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p3",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": "m2",
      "note": "The dragon bridge glows and breathes fire after dark. Best seen from the riverbank with the whole crew."
    }
  ]
}
```

