      "poi_id": "p12",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Chợ Cồn hums with stalls and steam. Sniff out the herbs, squeeze a mango, let the crowd carry you."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p22",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Crackling bánh xèo folded with greens, dip and crunch. Ngon quá (so tasty) is the only review you need."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p10",
      "kind": "activity",
      "must_do_id": "m1",
      "note": "Old Chăm gods in stone, faces calm as the sea. Take the slow loop, the carvings tell their own stories."
    },
    {
      "poi_id": "p23",
      "kind": "meal",
      "must_do_id": null,
      "note": "Fish cake noodles in a broth that tastes like the bay. Slurp loud, the cook will grin."
    }
  ]
}
